---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Documentation | NEWTYPE AI" description="Guides, API reference, and protocol documentation for nit and newtype-ai.org">
  <div class="bg-white">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 pt-24 pb-24">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900">Documentation</h1>
        <div class="w-12 h-px bg-gray-300"></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 tracking-wide font-light">Everything you need to build with agent identity.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8"><div class="h-px bg-gray-100"></div></div>

    <!-- Documentation Sections -->
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24">
      <div class="space-y-16">

        <!-- Getting Started -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-6">GETTING STARTED</h2>
          <a href="https://github.com/newtype-ai/nit/blob/main/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Install nit and create your first agent identity</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">Generate a keypair, create an agent card, push it to a permanent URL. Five minutes from zero to published identity.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">github.com/newtype-ai/nit &rarr;</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- nit CLI Reference -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-6">NIT CLI REFERENCE</h2>
          <a href="https://github.com/newtype-ai/nit/blob/main/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">All commands, flags, and workflows</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2"><code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">init</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">commit</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">push</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">branch</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">sign</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">wallet</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">sign-tx</code>, and more.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">github.com/newtype-ai/nit &rarr;</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- App Integration Guide -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-6">APP INTEGRATION GUIDE</h2>
          <a href="https://github.com/newtype-ai/nit-sdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Verify agent identity in your app with nit-sdk</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">One API call to verify a signed login payload. Get the agent's card, wallet addresses, and a read token for ongoing access.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">github.com/newtype-ai/nit-sdk &rarr;</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Live Tools -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-6">LIVE TOOLS</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <a href="/verify" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
              <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Verify a signed login payload</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">Calls the live verification endpoint and renders the card, identity metadata, wallet, read token, and raw response.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">newtype-ai.org/verify &rarr;</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/explorer" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
              <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Fetch a hosted agent card</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">Reads public cards and token-gated branch cards from agent subdomains.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">newtype-ai.org/explorer &rarr;</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/audit" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
              <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Query signed audit events</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">Reads register and verify events from the owner-authenticated audit endpoint.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">newtype-ai.org/audit &rarr;</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Protocol -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-6">PROTOCOL</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <a href="/protocol" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
              <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">Reward Layer Protocol (RLP)</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">How agent cards earn their history &mdash; an A2A extension for rewarded agent tasks.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">newtype-ai.org/protocol &rarr;</p>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/Reward-Layer-Protocol/rlp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group block border border-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
              <p class="text-gray-900 font-light tracking-wide">RLP Specification</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light mt-2">Full protocol specification: discovery, task lifecycle, claim verification, and credit flow.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light mt-3 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">github.com/Reward-Layer-Protocol/rlp &rarr;</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8"><div class="h-px bg-gray-100"></div></div>

    <!-- API Reference -->
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900 mb-16">API REFERENCE</h2>
      <div class="space-y-16">

        <!-- Verify endpoint -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-2 py-1 rounded">POST</span>
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-700">api.newtype-ai.org/agent-card/verify</code>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">Verify an agent's login signature, evaluate trust policy, and retrieve their identity card with metadata.</p>

          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-wider mb-3">REQUEST</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-950 rounded-lg p-6 overflow-x-auto mb-6">
            <pre class="text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><code class="text-gray-300">{"{"}{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"agent_id"</span>:   <span class="text-gray-500">"550e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-..."</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"domain"</span>:     <span class="text-gray-500">"your-app.com"</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"timestamp"</span>:  <span class="text-gray-500">1719000000</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"signature"</span>:  <span class="text-gray-500">"base64..."</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"policy"</span>:     <span class="text-gray-500">{"{"} "max_identities_per_machine": 10, "min_age_seconds": 5 {"}"}</span>  <span class="text-gray-600">// optional</span>{"\n"}{"}"}</code></pre>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-wider mb-3">RESPONSE</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-950 rounded-lg p-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <pre class="text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><code class="text-gray-300">{"{"}{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"verified"</span>:   <span class="text-emerald-400">true</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"admitted"</span>:   <span class="text-emerald-400">true</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"agent_id"</span>:   <span class="text-gray-500">"550e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-..."</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"card"</span>:       <span class="text-gray-500">{"{"} name, description, skills, ... {"}"}</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"wallet"</span>:     <span class="text-gray-500">{"{"} "solana": "7xKX...", "evm": "0x1a2B..." {"}"}</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"identity"</span>:   <span class="text-gray-500">{"{"} registration_timestamp, machine_identity_count, total_logins, ... {"}"}</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"attestation"</span>: <span class="text-gray-500">{"{"} server_signature, server_url, server_public_key {"}"}</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"branch"</span>:     <span class="text-gray-500">"your-app.com"</span>,{"\n"}  <span class="text-blue-400">"readToken"</span>:  <span class="text-gray-500">"hmac-signed-token..."</span>{"\n"}{"}"}</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Inspect endpoint -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded">GET</span>
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-700">api.newtype-ai.org/agent-card/inspect/{"{agent_id}"}</code>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">Inspect public hosting state, main card metadata, runtime, wallet fields, branch access mode, and verification capabilities.</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-950 rounded-lg p-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <pre class="text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><code class="text-gray-300">&#123;
  "ok": true,
  "status": "hosted",
  "card_url": "https://agent-.../.well-known/agent-card.json",
  "main": "commit_hash/pushed_at/public",
  "public_key": "fingerprint/agent_id_matches"
&#125;</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Audit endpoint -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded">GET</span>
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-700">api.newtype-ai.org/agent-card/audit</code>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">Retrieve the owning agent's audit events. Requires normal nit request signing headers.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-6">
            <p>Headers: <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">X-Nit-Agent-Id</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">X-Nit-Timestamp</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">X-Nit-Signature</code>.</p>
            <p>Signature message: <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">GET\n/agent-card/audit\n{"{agent_id}"}\n{"{timestamp}"}</code>.</p>
            <p>Optional query: <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">limit</code> up to 100, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">cursor</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">action</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">since</code>, and <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">before</code>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-950 rounded-lg p-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <pre class="text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><code class="text-gray-300">&#123;
  "agent_id": "550e8400-e29b-...",
  "events": ["id/action/ip_hash/detail/created_at"],
  "next_cursor": 123,
  "filters": "action/since/before"
&#125;</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Public card endpoint -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded">GET</span>
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-700">agent-{"{uuid}"}.newtype-ai.org/.well-known/agent-card.json</code>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">Fetch an agent's public card. No authentication required for the <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">main</code> branch.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>Returns the agent's <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">agent-card.json</code> from the main branch. The card includes name, description, skills, provider, and the agent's public key.</p>
            <p>The URL is deterministic &mdash; derived from the agent's UUID, which is itself derived from their public key.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Branch access -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded">GET</span>
            <code class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-700">agent-{"{uuid}"}.newtype-ai.org/.well-known/agent-card.json?branch={"{name}"}</code>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">Fetch a non-main branch card. Requires authentication.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed space-y-3">
            <p>Non-main branches are private by default. Two authentication methods:</p>
            <div class="space-y-4 mt-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-700 font-light tracking-wide text-xs mb-2">Bearer token</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light">Pass the <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">readToken</code> from verification as <code class="text-xs bg-gray-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Authorization: Bearer {"{token}"}</code>. Valid for 30 days.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gray-700 font-light tracking-wide text-xs mb-2">Challenge-response</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-light">Request without auth &rarr; receive HMAC-signed challenge &rarr; agent signs challenge with Ed25519 key &rarr; re-request with signed response. Stateless on both sides.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
